<newsitem itemid="263543" id="root" date="1996-12-18" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Reuters' 57th ex-UK air cargo market report.</title>
<headline>Reuters' 57th ex-UK air cargo market report.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average ex-UK GBP air cargo market rates per kg for a 100kg shipment, with a volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one. Rates are inclusive of cargo fuel surcharges being applied to airlines.</p>
<p>			Dec 18    vs    Nov 29</p>
<p>		   UNITED STATES</p>
<p> LON-JFK	    0.63		0.63</p>
<p> LON-LAX	    0.75		0.73</p>
<p> LON-CHI	    0.75		0.74</p>
<p>		   ASIA-PACIFIC</p>
<p> LON-HKG	    1.25		1.22</p>
<p> LON-SIN	    1.30		1.29</p>
<p> LON-NRT	    2.10		2.05</p>
<p> LON-SEL	    2.05		2.00</p>
<p> LON-SYD	    2.19		2.17</p>
<p>		   MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p> LON-DXB	    0.87		0.87</p>
<p> LON-BAH	    0.95		0.95</p>
<p>		   AFRICA</p>
<p> LON-JNB	    1.80		1.80</p>
<p>		   SCANDINAVIA</p>
<p> LON-STO	    0.76		0.74</p>
<p> LON-CPH	    0.72		0.70</p>
<p>		   LATIN AMERICA</p>
<p> LON-SAO	    2.08		2.06</p>
<p> LON-BUE	    2.23		2.25</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents based at the three main London airports.</p>
<p>*All prices quoted in sterling.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative or current market activity. - Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
